# AI service domains for Surge RULE-SET
# Reviewed: 2026-11-23 (Asia/Singapore)
# Service-scoped domains from supplied research; official and community evidence are mixed.
# Includes shared third-party dependencies below; they also match non-AI traffic.
# Inbound IP rules are at the end; unresolved entries are documented in REVIEW.md.
# Review scope, evidence and exclusions: REVIEW.md
# This list is not claimed to be complete.

