# ===== Shared dependencies =====
# Shared third-party dependencies for AI services
# Reviewed: 2026-11-23 (Asia/Singapore)
# Mixed official/community candidates for login, captcha,
# payment, support, telemetry or uploads. Not all are required by every client.
# Adding them to an AI policy will also divert non-AI traffic.
# Do not expand these to root domains such as googleapis.com, cloudflare.com,
# stripe.com, auth0.com, amazonaws.com, or facebook.com.

# ===== OpenAI / ChatGPT official shared allowlist =====
# https://help.openai.com/en/articles/9247338-network-recommendations-for-chatgpt-errors-on-web-and-apps
# Login / enterprise SSO (WorkOS)
DOMAIN,cdn.workos.com
DOMAIN,forwarder.workos.com
DOMAIN,frontend-apps-multi-region.workos.com
DOMAIN,images.workoscdn.com
DOMAIN,setup.workos.com
DOMAIN,workos.imgix.net
# Support chat (Intercom). DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercom.io will catch all Intercom customers.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercom.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercomcdn.com
# Payment
DOMAIN,js.stripe.com
# Cloudflare bot challenge (shared)
DOMAIN,challenges.cloudflare.com
# Email click tracking
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ct.sendgrid.net
# Apple device attestation / App Attest
DOMAIN,humb.apple.com
DOMAIN,register.appattest.apple.com
# Telemetry / error reporting (OpenAI-specific Sentry projects; Datadog is shared)
DOMAIN,o207216.ingest.sentry.io
DOMAIN,o33249.ingest.sentry.io
DOMAIN,o33249.ingest.us.sentry.io
DOMAIN,rum.browser-intake-datadoghq.com
DOMAIN,browser-intake-datadoghq.com
# Community: Arkose captcha, Statsig feature flags, Qualtrics surveys, LiveKit TURN (shared)
DOMAIN,openai-api.arkoselabs.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,client-api.arkoselabs.com
DOMAIN,api.statsig.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,featuregates.org
DOMAIN,openai.qualtrics.com
DOMAIN,host.livekit.cloud
DOMAIN,turn.livekit.cloud

