# ===== Inbound IP rules (after all domain rules) =====
# Claude API / Console inbound IPs; not outbound MCP source networks.
# Verified 2026-11-23: https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/ip-addresses
# Place after domain rules. no-resolve avoids DNS solely for these IP matches.
IP-CIDR,160.79.104.0/23,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,153.61.224.0/22,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2607:6bc0::/48,no-resolve
